        "description": "🔥Take on Horror in multiplayer co-op as you manage power to survive!\n\nDiscord: discord.gg/7fN6xPaeW5\n\nEnter if you dare into a haunted mall in our horror puzzle game, perfect for two-player online co-op with real-time voice chat. Dive into the mystery, uncover secrets, and face your fears together. Don't hesitate to join us for a real horror journey!\n\n# 🤖Game Features🤖\n**Immersive Horror Experience**: Realistic scenes and terrifying sounds create a pure horror atmosphere that keeps your adrenaline pumping!\n\n**Multiplayer Social Hangout**: Team up with a friend for double the scares and fun! Work together to solve challenging puzzlers, survive monster madness and escape the nightmare.\n\n**Real-time Voice Chat**: Communicate easily with your partner in real-time!\n\n**Realistic Physics**: Lifelike interactions and collisions make every scare feel real!\n\n**Dark Mysteries**: Uncover the mall's darkest mysteries as you face your fears!\n\nWill you survive the night?",
